\]
Thus,
\[
\frac{\sum_{i=1}^n a_i(a_i + b_i)}{\sum_{i=1}^n b_i(a_i + b_i)} = \frac{2 - \epsilon}{2 - 2\epsilon + 2\epsilon^2} \to \frac{2}{2} = 1 \text{ as } \epsilon \to 0.
