The factor pairs of 8 are \((1, 8)\), \((-1, -8)\), \((2, 4)\), and \((-2, -4)\). Solving these, we find:
$$
c - 2 - k = 1, \quad c - 2 + k = 8 \quad \Rightarrow \quad c = \frac{9}{2} \quad (\text{not an integer}).
