Thus, the only solutions are \( f(x) = x \) or \( f(x) = \begin{cases} n & \text{if } x = 1 \\ 1 & \text{if } x > 1 \text{ is odd} \\ 2 & \text{if } x \text{ is even} \end{cases} \) for any \( n \) odd.
