\]
This simplifies to \( c^2 |A| |B| = |A| |B| |C| \), so \( c^2 = |C| \). Since \( |C| \) is an integer, \( c \) must be an integer. Therefore, \( c = \pm 1 \).

The solution is \( W(a,b) = 1 \) or \( W(a,b) = -1 \) for all \( a, b \in \{1, 2, \ldots, n\} \).
