If \(f(a,b) = 1\) for all \(a \neq b\), then for any distinct \(a, b, c\):
\[ f(a,b)f(b,c) = 1 \cdot 1 = 1 \neq 2, \]
which is a contradiction. Therefore, \(f(a,b) = -1\) for all \(a \neq b\).

Thus, the only function \(W\) that satisfies the given condition is:
